# Story Edit Rules

## 1. Never strip chapter text when filing elsewhere

If the user says put text in Notes or References:
- Copy it there
- Leave the chapter text in place
- Filing is a copy, never a move
- Never erase chapter content to put it in a reference file

## 2. Never wipe chapter files

Do not blank, reverse or overwrite a whole `Story/Chapters/` file. Edit with targeted replacements only.
